     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Jurgen,<div><br></div><div>Recently, I was checking <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/camtrapR/vignettes/ImageOrganisation.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/camtrapR/vignettes/ImageOrganisation.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792460709505000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3x941GeXSNE-I2cCENhh5w\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/camtrapR/vignettes/ImageOrganisation.html</a> but I only was able to see part 1. Organising raw camera trap images in camtrapR. How can I to have access to  the other vignettes? I find this message &quot;The requested URL was not found on this server&quot;.</div><div><br></div><div>Many thanks,</div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" color=\"#666666\">----------------------------------------------<br><b>Angela Andrea Camargo Sanabria</b><br><font size=\"1\">Académica Cátedras Conacyt - Universidad Autónoma de Chihuahua</font></font></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:x-small\"><font color=\"#666666\">Facultad de Zootecnia y Ecología</font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:x-small\"><font color=\"#666666\">CP 31453, Chihuahua, México</font></span></div><div><div><div><div><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"1\" color=\"#666666\">skype: angela.camargo26<br></font></div></div></div></div></div><div><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"1\" color=\"#666666\">- Perfil RG <a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Angela_Camargo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.goo